## What's new

- **Directory tree in the sidebar** — one per window, folders only, like Total
  Commander. Toggle with `⌘⇧E` or the button next to the traffic lights.
- **The side mouse buttons now go back and forward** in the pane under the
  pointer.
- **Tab tooltips show their keyboard shortcuts.**
]]></description>
